# Sparkle EdDSA private key. It belongs in the login Keychain and a
# password manager, never in this repo. The patterns are deliberately wide:
# generate_keys names its export after whatever you pass to -x, and the
# obvious names people type have spaces and capitals that a single
# lowercase-hyphen pattern misses. A leaked signing key cannot be quietly
# rotated -- anyone already running an older build trusts only the old one.
private-key.txt
*private-key*
*private_key*
*privatekey*
*PrivateKey*
*Private Key*
*private key*
*PRIVATE KEY*
*.privkey
